{%- comment -%}
  ============================================================================
  Section: Customer register (create-account page, /account/register)
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Shopify's sign-up page, in the same design as the sign-in popup:
  the card from snippets/global-account-forms.liquid, starting on
  "Create account" (first / last name, email, password, newsletter opt-in).

  - If the account can't be created (e.g. email already used), Shopify
    reloads this page and the card shows its messages, keeping the names
    and email typed in.
  - After signing up the customer is signed in and sent to their account.

  Used in:   templates/customers/register.json
  Snippets:  snippets/global-account-forms.liquid (+ panel, field)
  CSS:       assets/global-account.css (classes .account-page, .account-card*)
  JS:        assets/global-account.js (views, password toggle)
  Text:      locales → customer.*
  ============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="page-width account-page">
  {% render 'global-account-forms', context: 'page', view: 'register' %}
</div>

{%- comment -%}
  Schema (theme editor settings) — JSON cannot contain comments, so they live here.
  No section settings: the side panel is set in Theme settings > Customer accounts.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Customer register",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section-customer-register",
  "enabled_on": {
    "templates": ["customers/register"]
  },
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Side panel image, heading, text and perks: Theme settings > Customer accounts."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
